 ## Overview
-Compact Voxel Octree Raycasting is a CPU-based ray traversal algorithm for Sparse Voxel Octrees (SVO) that optimizes memory layout and traversal logic by compacting active ray-voxel interactions and decoding node masks on-the-fly [S2, unofficial]. It solves the problem of inefficient traversal in sparse structures by using an explicit stack to manage non-sequential memory layouts and a parallel "COMPACTIFY" step to filter out non-intersecting rays, ensuring that only valid ray-voxel pairs are processed in subsequent levels [S1, S2, unofficial]. Unlike recursive or parametric approaches, it relies on a linear block structure with explicit state management, making it suitable for high-performance CPU implementations where memory bandwidth and cache locality are critical [S2, unofficial]. It builds on [CPU Sparse Voxel Octree Traversal](2455-cpu-sparse-voxel-octree-traversal.md) and differs from [Parametric Octree Traversal](2361-parametric-octree-traversal.md), [Iterative Octree Traversal](2618-iterative-octree-traversal.md), [Recursive Octree Traversal](2632-recursive-voxel-octree-traversal.md), and [Sparse Voxel Octree Path Tracing](2988-sparse-voxel-octree-path-tracing.md) by explicitly managing traversal state and compacting active ray lists between levels.
+Compact Voxel Octree Raycasting is a CPU-based ray traversal algorithm for Sparse Voxel Octrees that optimizes memory layout and traversal logic by compacting active ray-voxel interactions and decoding node masks on-the-fly [S2, unofficial]. It solves the problem of inefficient traversal in sparse structures by using an explicit stack to manage non-sequential memory layouts and a parallel "COMPACTIFY" step to filter out non-intersecting rays, ensuring that only valid ray-voxel pairs are processed in subsequent levels [S1, S2, unofficial]. Unlike recursive or parametric approaches, it relies on a linear block structure with explicit state management, making it suitable for high-performance CPU implementations where memory bandwidth and cache locality are critical [S2, unofficial]. It builds on [CPU Sparse Voxel Octree Traversal](2455-cpu-sparse-voxel-octree-traversal.md) and differs from [Parametric Octree Traversal](2361-parametric-octree-traversal.md), [Iterative Octree Traversal](2618-iterative-octree-traversal.md), [Recursive Octree Traversal](2632-recursive-voxel-octree-traversal.md), and [Sparse Voxel Octree Path Tracing](2988-sparse-voxel-octree-path-tracing.md) by explicitly managing traversal state and compacting active ray lists between levels.
 
